              "heading": "Velvera Plus — Extended Protection & Accidental Damage Plan"
            },
            "text": "Velvera Plus is our premium, optional paid service plan designed to safeguard your Velvera product investment. Extend your warranty, gain accidental damage protection, and experience prioritized support—ensuring peace of mind and seamless service, year after year."
